    skos:definition 'The change in the relative abundance of 13C (also referred to as delta-13C) isotope in carbon dioxide relative to the reference abundance measured in Vienna Pee Dee Belemnite standard. Samples are from an unfiltered body of salt or fresh water.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::D13CO2VP'^^xsd:string .
