    skos:altLabel 'DOC'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Concentration of organic carbon {organic_C CAS 7440-44-0} {DOC} per unit volume of the water body [dissolved plus reactive particulate specified elsewhere phase]'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A generic code for the quantification of organic carbon (i.e. carbon not in carbonate or bicarbonate molecules) dissolved in a unit volume of a water body. It may include values issued of both filtered and unfiltered water samples. Information about the filtration status and type is provided elsewhere in the metadata. Carbon may be expressed in terms of mass, volume or quantity of substance.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::DOCGZZ01'^^xsd:string .
