    skos:prefLabel 'Concentration of organic carbon {organic_C CAS 7440-44-0} {DOC} per unit volume of the water body [dissolved plus reactive particulate phase] by no filtration and assumption that POC is negligible'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Concentration of organic carbon (i.e. carbon not in carbonate or bicarbonate molecules) dissolved per unit volume of the water column. This is a DOC measurement obtained by measuring TOC and assuming that POC=0. Carbon may be expressed in terms of mass, volume or quantity of substance.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::CORGZZZX'^^xsd:string .
