    skos:prefLabel 'Consumption rate of oxygen {O2 CAS 7782-44-7} {respiration} per day per unit volume of the water body by 18O-H2O-tracer addition, in-vitro incubation and membrane inlet mass spectrometry (MIMS) and differencing between 18O-derived gross oxygen production and net changes in dissolved oxygen concentration over a 24h incubation period.'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Community respiration rates in a water sample measured over the natural 24-hour day-night cycle by subtracting net changes in oxygen concentrations to the gross oxygen production derived from 18O-spiked samples in parallel 24h incubations.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::RESP18ON'^^xsd:string .
