    skos:prefLabel 'Concentration as carbon of transparent exopolymer particle {TEP-C} per unit volume of the water body [particulate >0.4/0.45um phase] by filtration, Alcian blue staining and optical microscopy and image analysis and computation using Mari (1999) formula'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Concentration expressed as the amount (mass or number of moles) of carbon, computed using the formula from Mari (1999), in the transparent exopolymer particles retained by a 0.4/0.45 micron filter and identified through Alcian blue staining and optical microscopy, normalised to a unit volume of water sample.'@en ;
