    skos:definition 'The quantity of dissolved ions (predominantly salt in seawater) expressed on a scale (TEOS‐10), measured using \'Knudsen\' titration against silver nitrate and converted to Practical salinity using the appropriate algorithm from IOC, SCOR and IAPSO (2010), UNESCO, Paris.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::PSALKT01'^^xsd:string .
