    skos:definition 'Quantity or mass of the specified analyte in particles extracted from a known volume of sample of fresh or salt water by filtration; the filter size is either unknown or specified elsewhere in the metadata.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::PHYCZZZZ'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P01/current/PHYCFS01/1/> .
