    skos:altLabel 'Alpha_GFF_Platt'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Maximum light utilisation coefficient of carbon uptake {alpha} per hour per unit mass of chlorophyll-a per unit photosynthetic photon flux density in the water body [particulate >GF/F phase] by PvI incubation, filtration, acidification and scintillation counting and estimation from the model of Platt et al. (1980)'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The initial slope of a light-saturation or light-response curve such as a Photosynthesis versus Irradiance (PI or PE) curve. The parameter has been estimated by fitting the experimental data to the model of Platt et al. (1980).'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::ALPHGP07'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P01/current/PMAXGP07/1/> .
