    skos:altLabel 'Pmax_GFF_Platt'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Light-saturated maximum rate of carbon uptake per hour per unit mass of chlorophyll-a in the water body [particulate >GF/F phase] by PvI incubation, filtration, acidification and scintillation counting and estimation from the model of Platt et al. (1980)'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The maximum photosynthetic rate measured at optimal light intensity during a light-saturation or light-response curve such as a Photosynthesis versus Irradiance (PI or PE) curve. The parameter has been estimated by fitting the experimental data to the model of Platt et al. (1980).'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::PMAXGP07'^^xsd:string .
