    skos:altLabel 'Depth_aRPD_SPI'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Depth (spatial coordinate) mean of apparent redox potential discontinuity {aRPD} in the sediment by sediment profile imager and computation using ImageJ software'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A Sediment Profile Imaging (SPI) parameter derived from image analysis using the ImageJ software, defined as the average vertical distance below the sediment-water interface at which a discontinuity of colour is observed, providing an assessment of the average thickness of the oxygenated sediment surface layer.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::DPARPDIA'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P01/current/SRSDSW01/1/> .
