    skos:prefLabel 'Enrichment with respect to Vienna Pee Dee Belemnite (VPDB) of carbon-13 in inorganic carbon {13C in inorganic_C CAS 14762-74-4} {delta(13)C} in the water body [dissolved plus reactive particulate phase] by acidification and mass spectrometry'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The change in the relative abundance of 13C (also referred to as delta-13C) isotope in inorganic carbon relative to the reference abundance measured in Vienna Pee Dee Belemnite, from an unfiltered and acidified body of salt or fresh water.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::D13CMITV'^^xsd:string .
