    skos:prefLabel 'Area of layer above aRPD by sediment profile imager and computation using ImageJ software'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A sediment profile imaging parameter defined as the area enclosed between the apparent Redox Potential Discontinuity (aRPD) and the sediment-water interface determined by the ImageJ software over the width of the image being analysed. This parameter is used to calculate the mean vertical depth of the aRPD.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::ARPDIA01'^^xsd:string .
