    skos:altLabel 'd13POC>GF/F_VPDB'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Enrichment with respect to Vienna Pee Dee Belemnite (VPDB) of carbon-13 in organic carbon {13C in organic_C CAS 14762-74-4} {delta(13)C} in the water body [particulate >GF/F phase] by filtration, acidification, combustion and mass spectrometry'@en ;
    skos:definition 'Enrichment of 13C relative to Vienna Pee Dee Belemnite standard (also referred to as delta-13C) in organic carbon from a body of salt or fresh water and retained on a GF/F filter. Combustion step may occur within elemental analyser if linked to mass spectrometer. Measurement is either a single determination or the average of replicates.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::D13CEAM1'^^xsd:string .
<feed> tree:member <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P01/current/D15NEAM1/1/> .
