    skos:prefLabel 'Enrichment of nitrogen-15 in total nitrogen {15N_in_total_N CAS 14390-96-6} {delta(15)N} in the water body [particulate >GF/F phase] by filtration, acidification, combustion and mass spectrometry'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The difference in the proportion of 15N isotope between the nitrogen in the residue of a GF/F filtered sample of water from any fresh or salt water body and a reference standard. Acidification step is due to concurrent elemental analysis and IR-MS of both particulate C and N. Combustion step may occur within elemental analyser linked to mass spectrometer. Measurement is either a single determination or the average of replicates.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::D15NEAM1'^^xsd:string .
