    dc:modified '2024-03-01T10:02:54'^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:altLabel 'VolScattering_Beta_412nm'^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel 'Volume scattering coefficient of electromagnetic radiation (412nm wavelength) {Beta} in the water body by in-situ optical backscatter measurement'@en ;
    skos:definition 'The radiant intensity of scattered light from the water body as a function of angle, measured at the specified wavelength by an in-situ optical backscattering instrument. Volume scattering coefficient (Beta) is calculated by subtracting dark counts from the raw counts then multiplying by the manufacturer-supplied calibration scale factor.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:P01::BVSFO412'^^xsd:string .
